---
description: English and Slovenian text, spell check, and per-language behavior in the editor
globs: src/**/editor/**,src/**/*spell*,src/**/*i18n*
alwaysApply: false
---
- Content language is stored per project/chapter and can be set per selection (en, sl).
- Spell check: first verify whether the WebView2 built-in spell checker supports Slovenian on the target laptop. If not, use bundled Hunspell dictionaries (en, sl) via a small JS library; keep it off the main thread where possible.
- Personal dictionary persists per user and survives updates.
- Typography: use proper quotes per language; do not auto-replace characters in a way that breaks Slovenian letters.
